# Never let line-ending conversion touch these. A PDF carries byte offsets in
# its xref table; one CRLF on a Windows checkout and the reader says "damaged".
*.pdf  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4  binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3  binary
*.ogg  binary
*.wav  binary
*.woff2 binary
